{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clocknockers 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">July 28th, 2069, The Clocknockers appeared here one week ago and they are messing with time again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have to travel back one day at a time for 7 days to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several challenging levels with cool time bending effects...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- When You move, time moves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- SlowMo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Freeze</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rewind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Drive backward thru time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Time Pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time Based Platforming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cool &quot;Digitruck&quot; Time Machine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy the Clocknockers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun and Challenging 7 Days, 7 Levels with different time mechanics to master as You travel back in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examples - When You move, time moves ; Slow Motion/Bullet-Time ; Freeze Time ; Rewind ; Drive backward thru time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... and more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344420?t=1732694582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1732694582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344420/b3112555eea20b91fa09ad7cc8ad06fd4e86849b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1732694582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344420/b3112555eea20b91fa09ad7cc8ad06fd4e86849b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1732694582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clocknockers 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">July 28th, 2069, The Clocknockers appeared here one week ago and they are messing with time again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have to travel back one day at a time for 7 days to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several challenging levels with cool time bending effects...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- When You move, time moves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- SlowMo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Freeze</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rewind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Drive backward thru time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Time Pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time Based Platforming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cool &quot;Digitruck&quot; Time Machine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy the Clocknockers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun and Challenging 7 Days, 7 Levels with different time mechanics to master as You travel back in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examples - When You move, time moves ; Slow Motion/Bullet-Time ; Freeze Time ; Rewind ; Drive backward thru time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... and more!</p>","developers":["Archor Wright"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344420/header.jpg?t=1732694582","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257072271,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257072271/movie480.mp4?t=1731525232","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257072271/movie_max.mp4?t=1731525232"},"name":"Clocknockers 3 - Tra